<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pl">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#090812">
<title>KQ STRIKE — Coming Soon</title>

<style>
* {
    box-sizing: border-box;
}

body {
    margin: 0;
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 50% 0%, #7048e855, transparent 45%),
        #090812;
    color: white;
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 20px;
}

.container {
    max-width: 600px;
    width: 100%;
    padding: 45px 25px;
    border: 1px solid #ffffff20;
    border-radius: 25px;
    background: #171526;
    box-shadow: 0 20px 70px #0008;
}

.logo {
    color: #a987ff;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: bold;
    letter-spacing: 5px;
}

.icon {
    font-size: 75px;
    margin: 30px 0 10px;
}

h1 {
    font-size: clamp(35px, 8vw, 55px);
    margin: 10px 0;
    letter-spacing: -2px;
}

h1 span {
    color: #9870ff;
}

.coming {
    display: inline-block;
    margin: 20px 0;
    padding: 12px 23px;
    border: 1px solid #9870ff88;
    border-radius: 30px;
    background: #9870ff20;
    color: #c7b3ff;
    font-weight: bold;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
}

p {
    color: #aaa4bd;
    line-height: 1.7;
}

.back {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 25px;
    padding: 13px 23px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: linear-gradient(100deg, #7048e8, #9870ff);
    color: white;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: bold;
}

.back:hover {
    filter: brightness(1.2);
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="container">

    <div class="logo">KQ COMPANY PRESENTS</div>

    <div class="icon" id="gameIcon">🎯</div>

    <h1 id="gameName">KQ STRIKE</h1>

    <div class="coming">COMING SOON</div>

    <p>
        Przygotowujemy coś wyjątkowego! 
        Gra KQ STRIKE jest jeszcze w produkcji.
        Wróć wkrótce i sprawdź premierę!
    </p>

    <a class="back" href="../../index.html#games">
        ← POWRÓT DO KQ GAMES
    </a>

</div>

<script>
const GAME_NAME = "KQ STRIKE";
document.getElementById("gameName").textContent = GAME_NAME;
document.title = GAME_NAME + " — Coming Soon";
</script>

</body>
</html>
